SUMMARY:Digital Literacy: Computer Basics
DESCRIPTION:Improve your computer\, technology\, and phone skills! JBNC is offering a rotating 6-class schedule on a variety of topics\, from Computer Basics to Smartphones & Everyday Technology.  \nLocation: JBNC Computer Lab\nTime: 1pm – 3pm \nTopics include: \n\n\nComputer Basics: November 2 & 16\nInternet Basics & Searching: November 3 & 17\nEmail & Online Communication: November 4 & 18\nOnline Safety & Avoiding Scams: November 5 & 19\nSmartphones & Everyday Technology: November 6 & 20\nIntro to AI: November 11 & December 2 (Please use this link to register)\n\nCall 317-223-0959 or click here to register for an upcoming class.
URL:https://jbncenters.org/event/digital-literacy-computer-basics-2026/2026-11-17/
LOCATION:John Boner Neighborhood Centers\, 2236 E. 10th St.\, Indianapolis\, 46205\, United States
CATEGORIES:Digital Literacy,Financial Success
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jbncenters.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Digital-Literacy-Classes-Computer-Basics.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="JBNC Financial Success Department":MAILTO:financialsuccess@jbncenters.org
END:VEVENT
