UID:9417-1796029200-1796058000@jbncenters.org
SUMMARY:Customer Services Essential Certification
DESCRIPTION:The SNAP Employment & Training (E&T) Program connects SNAP recipients with valuable employment and training opportunities. Individuals will learn to strengthen and build new skills for careers across a variety of industries. Gain tools that will help you improve your personal and professional communication skills\, including but not limited to: \n\nWord choice\nVoice tone\nBody language\nActive listening\nEmpathy\nHow to diffuse difficult situations\n\nThis certification will count toward the *NEW* SNAP benefit requirements.\nContact Your JBNC Coach or Family Navigator to sign-up. Questions? Email financialsuccess@jbncenters.org or call 317.633.8201. \nPresented by JBNC and Goodwill of Central & Southern Indiana
URL:https://jbncenters.org/event/customer-services-essential-certification/
LOCATION:John Boner Neighborhood Centers\, 2236 E. 10th St.\, Indianapolis\, 46205\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adult Programs,Community,Family Success
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jbncenters.org/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/pexels-gustavo-fring-3874034-1-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
