UID:9411-1796216400-1796223600@jbncenters.org
SUMMARY:Digital Literacy: Intro to AI
DESCRIPTION:We teamed up with Verizon to bring you the best AI training from IBM\, Google\, Coursera and other tech leaders. For wherever you’re starting and as far as you want to go. \nVerizon & LISC have launched FREE AI Skills for America learning platform to empower job seekers\, early career professionals\, displaced workers\, educators\, and small businesses with theskills needed to thrive in the AI era and strengthen the U.S. economy. The initiative supports digital literacy and provides open access to AI platforms such as google\, IBM\, and Coursera. The platform has a wide range of courses for all skill levels. Call 317-223-0959 or register online today  \nLocation: JBNC Computer Lab\nTime: 1pm – 3pm \nTopics include: \n\n\nComputer Basics: November 2 & 16\nInternet Basics & Searching: November 3 & 17\nEmail & Online Communication: November 4 & 18\nOnline Safety & Avoiding Scams: November 5 & 19\nSmartphones & Everyday Technology: November 6 & 20\nIntro to AI: November 11 & December 2 (Please use this link to register)
URL:https://jbncenters.org/event/digital-literacy-intro-to-ai/2026-12-02/
LOCATION:John Boner Neighborhood Centers\, 2236 E. 10th St.\, Indianapolis\, 46205\, United States
CATEGORIES:Digital Literacy,Financial Success
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jbncenters.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AI-Digital-Literacy-Website-Header-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="JBNC Financial Success Department":MAILTO:financialsuccess@jbncenters.org
END:VEVENT
